	linkml:description "A description of a control and how it applies to a given architecture" , "A more detailed description of the control and information on what a developer needs to consider" , "Detailed description of the flow's purpose" , "Functional summary of what is happening in the transition" , "What choosing this option means." , "What the node is and does." , "What the relationship is for." ;
	linkml:required true ;
